        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-FPGA-BEYOND-735.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-735-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH736-SILICON-DIE-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH737-SUBSTRATE-CONT-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH738-INTERPOSER-LAT-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH739-740M-SAAT-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
